      "name": "Avatar",
      "id": "2578:1831",
      "description": "User/entity avatar showing initials, photo, or company logo. Color axis provides 9 distinct seeds for initial-based avatars; seed from a stable hash of user ID — never random. Dark toggle inverts colors for dark surfaces and inverse cards. Photo and Logo are content-aware content modes. Use in activity feeds, comment threads, user lists, presence indicators, and permissioned resources. See also: Badge / Status for small inline status dots.",
