  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Avatar",
    "Description",
    "User/entity avatar rendered as initials, photo, or logo. Color axis assigns a deterministic seed from the user's name.",
    "Modes",
    "Initials   Default. 1–2 uppercase characters. Color seeded from user ID.\nPhoto      Uploaded image. Cropped to circle.\nLogo       Company/team mark. Centered, not cropped.",
    "Dark",
    "Toggle Dark on when rendering on inverted surfaces (dark sidebars, photo headers). Swaps surface and text tokens for contrast.",
    "Color",
    "Neutral, Red, Orange, Yellow, Green, Turquoise, Blue, Purple, Pink.\nSeed from a stable hash of user ID — never random per render.",
    "Labels & Content",
    "Initials: 1–2 characters, uppercase (first letter of given name + family name).\nStrip diacritics; fall back to first two letters of display name.\nAlways pair with aria-label containing the full user/entity name.",
    "Rules",
    "DO   Seed color from a stable user ID hash\nDO   Use 1–2 uppercase initials\nDO   Provide aria-label with full name\nDO   Toggle Dark on inverted surfaces",
    "DON'T   Randomize color on each render\nDON'T   Stretch non-square photos\nDON'T   Use initials longer than 2 characters\nDON'T   Rely on color alone to distinguish users"
  ],
  "pageContext": null
